{{!
    @template tool_activitydates/coursenotes

    Hidden container of compact grade-lock notes for the course page. The
    tool_activitydates/coursenotes AMD module moves each note into the card of
    the activity named by its data-cmid; a note whose activity is not on the
    page stays in the hidden container.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-region="tool_activitydates-coursenotes" - the hidden container
    * data-cmid - the course module id each note belongs to

    Context variables required for this template:
    * notes array - one entry per note
      * cmid int - the course module id
      * islocked bool - whether the grade item is already locked
      * date string - the (already formatted) lock date to display

    Example context (json):
    {
        "notes": [
            { "cmid": 12, "islocked": false, "date": "Monday, 1 January 2026, 12:00 AM" },
            { "cmid": 15, "islocked": true, "date": "Friday, 1 August 2025, 9:00 AM" }
        ]
    }
}}
<div data-region="tool_activitydates-coursenotes" hidden>
    {{#notes}}
        <div class="tool_activitydates-coursenote small text-muted mt-1" data-cmid="{{cmid}}">
            {{#pix}} i/lock, core {{/pix}}
            {{#islocked}}
                {{#str}} gradelockednote, tool_activitydates, {{date}} {{/str}}
            {{/islocked}}
            {{^islocked}}
                {{#str}} gradelocknote, tool_activitydates, {{date}} {{/str}}
            {{/islocked}}
        </div>
    {{/notes}}
</div>
